<title>SINGAPORE: Malayan Credit appoints managing director.</title>
<headline>Malayan Credit appoints managing director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malayan Credit Ltd said on Tuesday it has appointed Lim Ee Seng as managing director with effect from November 18.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Lim will oversee the overall operations of the group.</p>
<p>Lim was previously the general manager of the property division at First Capital Corporation.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
